<title>RUSSIA: Ukraine to buy 5.9mln T domestic grain in 97 - agency.</title>
<headline>Ukraine to buy 5.9mln T domestic grain in 97 - agency.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine state purchases of domestic grain in 1997 will be 5.88 million tonnes, according to a cabinet decree, Interfax news agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>In quoted the government press service as saying the purchases would include 880,000 tonnes of non-food quality grain for alcohol production, 300,000 tonnes of seed grain and 4.7 million tonnes of other grain.</p>
</text>
